/*A friend predicates a relation.*/

/*
"friendship" is a noun.
Friendship is uncountable.
Friendship is a state of being a friend to a person or between persons.
Friendship is about being a friend to a person or between persons.
Friendship is a relationship.
If persons have friendship then the persons are friends.
If a 1st person is a friend of a 2nd person then the 2nd person is the friend of the 1st person,
and the 1st person and the 2nd person have friendship.
*/


